<scroll-view class="page-shell summary-page" scroll-y enhanced>
  <view class="summary-hero">
    <text class="summary-eyebrow">SUMMER REFLECTION</text>
    <text class="summary-main-title">这个夏天，</text>
    <text class="summary-main-title summary-main-title-second">我们留下了什么？</text>
    <text class="summary-intro">每个人都可以把自己的学习、研究、阅读和生活片段，汇成一段可被看见的夏天。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="overview-card">
    <view class="overview-primary">
      <text class="overview-number">{{total}}</text>
      <text class="overview-label">段生活记录</text>
    </view>
    <view class="overview-divider"></view>
    <view class="overview-secondary">
      <text class="overview-number small">{{userPosts}}</text>
      <text class="overview-label">条用户发布</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="stats-section">
    <view class="section-heading">
      <text class="section-title">暑假的组成</text>
      <text class="section-caption">按记录数量统计</text>
    </view>
    <block wx:for="{{stats}}" wx:key="name">
      <view class="bar-row">
        <text class="bar-label">{{item.name}}</text>
        <view class="bar-track">
          <view class="bar-fill bar-{{index}}" style="width: {{item.count / total * 100}}%"></view>
        </view>
        <text class="bar-value">{{item.count}}</text>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <view class="lessons-section">
    <view class="section-heading">
      <text class="section-title">三点收获</text>
      <text class="section-caption">来自暑假记录的共同体会</text>
    </view>
    <block wx:for="{{lessons}}" wx:key="number">
      <view class="lesson-card">
        <text class="lesson-number">{{item.number}}</text>
        <view class="lesson-copy">
          <text class="lesson-title">{{item.title}}</text>
          <text class="lesson-text">{{item.text}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <view class="final-note">
    <text class="final-mark">夏</text>
    <text class="final-text">如果一定要为这个暑假写一句结语，那就是：没有突然成为更厉害的人，但比假期开始时更清楚自己想继续做什么。</text>
  </view>

  <button class="timeline-action" bindtap="openTimeline">回看全部夏日足迹</button>
</scroll-view>
